  "description": "AVINOX M2S\n\nThe M2S motor delivers 150 Nm of torque, offering strong, progressive power that allows you to tackle steep climbs and technical trails with total confidence. Its efficient design optimizes energy consumption, ensuring consistent, stable, and surprisingly quiet performance on every ride. It also reaches up to 1300 W of peak power in Turbo mode, giving an instant response when you need it most and taking motor assistance to the highest level.\n\n800WH | LONG RANGE\n\nEquipped with an 800 Wh battery, providing up to 157 km of range.\n\n100% ENDURO | 170 MM TRAVEL\n\nExperience maximum performance with our e-MTB featuring 170 mm of travel, designed for the most aggressive and technical trails.\n\nEvery jump, rock, and descent becomes pure fun thanks to suspension and geometry that deliver total control and complete stability.\n\nINTEGRATED DISPLAY + LEFT/RIGHT WIRELESS CONTROLLERS\n\nThe 2” OLED touchscreen, fully integrated into the frame, delivers exceptional visibility in any condition.\n\nComplemented by wireless handlebar controllers, it creates a clean, minimalist cockpit ready for a superior riding experience.",
